source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: The brace form applies inside link text.
-- input.jira --
[a{*}b{*}c|http://x]
-- rendered.html --
<p><a href="http://x" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">a<b>b</b>c</a></p>
-- want.md --
[a**b**c](http://x)
-- warnings.json --
[]
